   },
   "suggested": "Модель, {model}, выбрана для этой беседы",
   "problem": "Gender agreement: «модель» is feminine, so the participle is «выбрана», not neuter «выбрано» (the effort sibling «Усилие … выбрано» is correctly neuter). Screen-reader label; audibly ungrammatical."
  },
  {
   "id": "RU-H02",
   "severity": "MINOR",
   "class": "awkward",
   "status": "open",
   "keys": [
    "mobile.home.chip.model_no_default"
   ],
   "current": {
    "mobile.home.chip.model_no_default": "Нет по умолчанию"
   },
   "suggested": "Не задана",
   "problem": "«Нет по умолчанию» is a calque with no noun to negate; «Не задана» (model is feminine; core ru uses «не задано» for unset values in wire.settings.model_effort.help) is natural and shorter on the narrow strip. The spoken label still says 'no default model'."
  }
 ],
